# Build-context filter for the Dockerfile beside this file.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the context
# root's `.dockerignore` — which matters here, because the context is
# `maxgame-admin-guard/` (see the Dockerfile header), which also holds `js/`,
# `contract/`, and this same `template/` tree's own `target/`. Without this,
# `docker build` would upload all of it.
#
# Ignore everything, then admit only the two trees the build needs.
*

!rust
!template

# …minus what must never enter a build context.
rust/target
rust/.git
template/target
template/.git
template/.env
template/.env.*
template/tests
**/*.md

**/.DS_Store
